      to watch","body":"Flip hasNoise: Idle aborts and ''investigate noise'' takes
      over.\nThen flip hasTarget: that branch aborts and ''engage target'' takes
      over.\n\nBoth Engage nodes run the same asset, so their inner nodes share guids.
      In the recording they are told apart by call site.\n\nIdle has two guards.
      Only the first one to go false is ever blamed, and the other is not evaluated
      that tick at all.","colorTheme":"Classic","guid":"9383becb-3d82-4ce3-953e-7183a3a3dded","$type":"ArcaneOnyx.GraphCore.StickyNote"},{"$ref":"12"},{"$ref":"18"},{"$ref":"22"},{"$ref":"26"},{"ScriptGraphVariable":{"returnType":"System.Object,
